# r1116 phase 4 (runner-4): SQ-PS15 group B (seed 8675309, normal world), one boot. Census probe zz_zcen.js
# (tools/scratch_query/zcen_probe.js): /zcen scan = chunk-centre surface biome, crop rule tag membership
# (creativedelight:wild_crops/KEY) and block counts / patches per chunk; /zcen grid = configured feature placed at
# 25 points (ground under canopy, one above the leaves, or a fixed y), placed blocks counted per point.
# Sites from r1115 p5_b1*.qb (locate centres): 1b -318 195, 2 1472 -3264, 3 -2072 2232; jungles -1380 -2724,
# 1892 -2372 (r1115 SQ-RD-26). Boxes 240 blocks (forceload cap 256 chunks). Census before any /zcen grid in a box.
# Extra forest boxes around site 2 for the adzuki 700 tag-chunk bar (SQ-PS15-12c).
pace 1

## SQ-PS15-4S | setup: boot, census probe live, rule tag sizes
bootexpect Done \(
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> zcen scan 0 0 31 31 hearthandharvest:hops_vine@wild_hops,farmersdelight:wild_carrots@carrot,farmersdelight:wild_onions@onion,neapolitan:adzuki_sprouts@adzuki,veggiesdelight:wild_broccoli@broccoli,veggiesdelight:wild_cauliflowers@cauliflower,veggiesdelight:wild_garlic@garlic,vintagedelight:wild_oats@oats,vintagedelight:wild_cucumbers@cucumbers,rusticdelight:wild_bell_peppers@bell_pepper,rusticdelight:wild_pale_bell_peppers@bell_pepper,rusticdelight:wild_dark_bell_peppers@bell_pepper,rusticdelight:wild_coffee@coffee,delightful:mini_melon@mini_melon,farmersdelight:wild_rice@rice,farmersrespite:wild_tea_bush@tea,minecraft:melon@melon,minecraft:cocoa@cocoa,minecraft:oak_log@,minecraft:birch_log@,minecraft:jungle_log@
waitlog \[zcen\] scan done 300
reject \[zcen\] (error|warn)
look tag sizes (carrot 25, adzuki 18, wild_hops 18, bell_pepper 11), probe lines well formed

## SQ-PS15-11-s2 | census forest site 2 (1472 -3264)
> forceload remove all
> forceload add 1352 -3384 1591 -3145
sleep 60
> zcen scan 1352 -3384 1591 -3145 hearthandharvest:hops_vine@wild_hops,farmersdelight:wild_carrots@carrot,farmersdelight:wild_onions@onion,neapolitan:adzuki_sprouts@adzuki,veggiesdelight:wild_broccoli@broccoli,veggiesdelight:wild_cauliflowers@cauliflower,veggiesdelight:wild_garlic@garlic,vintagedelight:wild_oats@oats,vintagedelight:wild_cucumbers@cucumbers,rusticdelight:wild_bell_peppers@bell_pepper,rusticdelight:wild_pale_bell_peppers@bell_pepper,rusticdelight:wild_dark_bell_peppers@bell_pepper,rusticdelight:wild_coffee@coffee,delightful:mini_melon@mini_melon,farmersdelight:wild_rice@rice,farmersrespite:wild_tea_bush@tea,minecraft:melon@melon,minecraft:cocoa@cocoa,minecraft:oak_log@,minecraft:birch_log@,minecraft:jungle_log@
