## SQ-PS15-12b-forest | canopy A/B, site 2: FD patch_wild_carrots at 25 canopy columns, origin one above the leaves, then on the ground
> zcen grid farmersdelight:patch_wild_carrots farmersdelight:wild_carrots 1472 -3264 5 16 canopy
waitlog \[zcen\] grid done 300
> zcen grid farmersdelight:patch_wild_carrots farmersdelight:wild_carrots 1472 -3264 5 16 ground
waitlog \[zcen\] grid done 300
count \[zcen\] grid done >= 2
reject \[zcen\] (error|grid no configured)
look ground: most points place carrots; canopy: none

## SQ-PS15-11b-place | /place feature creativedelight:wild/wild_hops equivalent at the 25 r1115 points of site 2 (16 apart, origin y 70)
> zcen grid creativedelight:wild/wild_hops hearthandharvest:hops_vine 1472 -3264 5 16 y70
waitlog \[zcen\] grid done 300
reject \[zcen\] (error|grid no configured)
look placed_points 22 or more of 25 (r1115: 1)

